    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>description</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3146 characters\">&lt;h6&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;RICHMINIS - Kids Woven Cross Strap&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Embrace high-end resort styling with our Jacquard Criss-Cross Sandals. Striking the perfect balance between global luxury trends and everyday functional comfort, these sandals feature an elegant, monochromatic print that brings a sophisticated, runway-ready look to your little one&#039;s warm-weather wardrobe.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h6&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Key Features&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Premium Jacquard Weave&lt;/b&gt;: Designed with wide, criss-cross straps featuring an intricately woven black-and-ivory tapestry pattern for a distinct luxury-boutique feel.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Ergonomic Contoured Footbed&lt;/b&gt;: Outfitted with a plush, smooth black leather-style footbed designed to gently cradle growing feet for all-day comfort.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Adjustable Hook-and-Loop Backstrap&lt;/b&gt;: Features a durable black leather-style ankle strap with a heavy-duty metal loop and secure closure, ensuring a customizable fit that&#039;s easy to adjust.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Chunky Protective Outsole&lt;/b&gt;: Built with a lightweight, flexible thick rubber sole that wraps slightly around the footbed for premium impact protection and stability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;High-Grip Traction&lt;/b&gt;: The textured under-sole is engineered to prevent slipping, making them perfect for resort strolls, weekend outings, or active city play.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h6&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Product Specifications&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Style&lt;/b&gt;: Criss-Cross Jacquard Slingback Sandal.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Upper Material&lt;/b&gt;: High-quality woven cotton jacquard and premium synthetic leather.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Sole Material&lt;/b&gt;: High-density flexible rubber.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Colorway&lt;/b&gt;: Natural Ivory.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Closure&lt;/b&gt;: Adjustable hook-and-loop backstrap.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h6&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Brand Insight&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;These sandals are designed for mothers who value a minimalist, international-class aesthetic over loud, cartoonish children&#039;s designs. Offering an upscale look reminiscent of high-fashion house aesthetics, they transition effortlessly from a casual day at the beach to an elegant family dinner, maintaining the premium standard your lifestyle ecosystem demands.&lt;/p&gt;</span>\"
