    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>description</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3292 characters\">&lt;h6&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;RICHMINIS - Kids Mid-Top Trainers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Introduce a bold, contemporary edge to your child&#8217;s wardrobe with our Retro Urban Mid-Top Trainers. Showcasing a high-end international look, these sneakers perfectly combine an architectural design with functional comfort&#8212;curated meticulously for mothers who appreciate a premium lifestyle look for their little ones.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h6&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Key Features&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Architectural Ribbed Midsole&lt;/b&gt;: Features a unique, chunky cream midsole with detailed vertical ribbing that provides superior shock absorption and an eye-catching, designer aesthetic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Premium Multi-Textured Upper&lt;/b&gt;: Crafted with a clean white leather-style base, complemented by earthy tan suede on the toe box and sleek charcoal grey panels.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Bold Contrast Overlays&lt;/b&gt;: Styled with sweeping black side accents and a circular ankle emblem that deliver a sharp, sporty, yet high-class finish.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Dual-Security Closure System&lt;/b&gt;: Combines elasticated neutral laces with a supportive hook-and-loop ankle strap to ensure a highly secure, adjustable fit that&#039;s easy to pull on and off.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Durable Hybrid Gum Outsole&lt;/b&gt;: Equipped with a classic rubber gum toe cap and under-sole wrap to ensure maximum traction and wrap-around protection during active play.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Plush Comfort Interior&lt;/b&gt;: A well-padded mesh collar and tongue keep little feet cushioned and breathing easy all day long.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h6&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Product Specifications&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Style&lt;/b&gt;: Mid-Top Architectural Streetwear Trainer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Material&lt;/b&gt;: Premium synthetic leather, suede overlays, and high-density rubber.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Colorway&lt;/b&gt;: Chalk White / Desert Tan / Charcoal / Carbon Black.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Closure&lt;/b&gt;: Adjustable Strap &amp;amp; Elastic Lacing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h6&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Why They Stand Out&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;These mid-tops move entirely away from standard children&#039;s patterns in favor of structured silhouettes and a highly curated color palette. Ideal for pairing with clean denim, relaxed joggers, or upscale casual streetwear, they offer the perfect balance of international boutique charm and rugged durability that fits effortlessly into a luxury lifestyle ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;</span>\"
